@startuml Sequence_Diagram_Shape

actor "User A" as UserA
participant "React\n(Konva Canvas)" as Canvas
participant "Shapes\nState" as State
participant "Y.Doc\n(CRDT)" as YDoc
participant "Socket.IO" as Socket
participant "Server\nY.Doc" as ServerY
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
actor "User B" as UserB

== Shape Creation (Rectangle Example) ==

UserA -> Canvas: Pointer Down (tool=rectangle)
Canvas -> Canvas: getWorldPointer(e) → {x, y}
Canvas -> State: setShapes([..., {id,type,x,y,width:0,height:0}])

UserA -> Canvas: Pointer Move (drag)
Canvas -> Canvas: compute width/height from delta
Canvas -> State: setShapes(prev → update width/height)
Canvas -> Canvas: emitShapeDraft(shape) [throttled 20fps]
Canvas -> Socket: emit("shape:draft", shape)
Socket --> UserB: broadcast("shape:draft")
UserB -> UserB: render draft (opacity 0.4, dashed)

UserA -> Canvas: Pointer Up
Canvas -> State: finalize shape dimensions

alt Arrow Tool
  Canvas -> YDoc: boardMap.set("shape:uuid", JSON.stringify(arrow))
end

Canvas -> YDoc: boardMap.set("shape:uuid", JSON.stringify(rect))
Canvas -> YDoc: Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(doc)
Canvas -> Socket: emit("yjs:update", { boardId, update })
Socket -> ServerY: Y.applyUpdate(doc, update)
ServerY -> ServerY: readShapesFromYBoard() → parse shapes

ServerY -> DB: replaceBoardShapes()
note right
  Diff algorithm:
  1. Build clientToDb map
  2. Compare JSON.stringify(data)
  3. Skip unchanged shapes
  4. Upsert only changed/created
end note

ServerY -> ServerY: debounced persist (500ms)

Socket --> UserB: broadcast("yjs:update", update)
UserB -> UserB: Y.applyUpdate(localDoc, update)
UserB -> UserB: syncShapesFromYDoc() → re-render
note right
  Merges remote committed shapes
  with local draft shapes
end note

== Eraser Tool ==

UserA -> Canvas: Pointer Down (tool=eraser)
Canvas -> State: create eraser stroke line

UserA -> Canvas: Pointer Move

UserA -> Canvas: Pointer Up
Canvas -> Canvas: getAABB(eraserStroke)
Canvas -> Canvas: quadtree.query(eraserBounds)
Canvas -> Canvas: forEach hitId → deleteShape
Canvas -> YDoc: remove shape:uuid from boardMap
Canvas -> Socket: emit("yjs:update")

== Undo ==

UserA -> Canvas: Ctrl+Z
Canvas -> Socket: emit("board:undo", { boardId })
Socket -> DB: force persist current state (save snapshot)
Socket -> DB: findSnapshotBeforeVersion()
Socket -> ServerY: applyShapesToDoc(old shapes)
Socket -> ServerY: Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(doc)
Socket --> UserA: emit("board:state", state)
Socket --> UserB: emit("board:state", state)

== Marquee Select ==

UserA -> Canvas: Pointer Down (tool=select)
UserA -> Canvas: Pointer Move (drag marquee)
Canvas -> Canvas: compute MarqueeRect {x,y,width,height}
UserA -> Canvas: Pointer Up
Canvas -> Canvas: quadtree.query(marqueeRect)
Canvas -> State: setSelectedShapeIds(hitIds)
note right
  O(log n) spatial query
  vs O(n) linear scan
end note

@enduml
